# Keep every text file byte-identical on all platforms. The sample evidence in
# docs/samples and the renderer fixtures are verified by SHA-256; Git for
# Windows' default CRLF conversion would otherwise change those bytes and make
# the published-provenance checks fail on a fresh Windows clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.mp4  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff2 binary
